{"id":1288,"slug":"empire-of-passion","title":"Empire of Passion","year":1978,"country":"Japan","duration":105,"spine":467,"url":"https://www.criterion.com/films/1288-empire-of-passion","cover":"https://s3.amazonaws.com/criterion-production/films/5cfc29b8af0201583b1d64c4beae9626/bsWUo0oqpwxG2OMIhPK2msUZUWW1Cr_large.jpg","description":"With an arresting mix of eroticism and horror, Oshima plunges the viewer into a nightmarish tale of guilt and retribution in Empire of Passion (Ai no borei). Set in a Japanese village at the end of the nineteenth century, the film details the emotional and physical downfall of a married woman and her younger lover following their decision to murder her husband and dump his body in a well. Empire of Passion was Oshima’s only true kaidan (Japanese ghost story), and the film, a savage, unrelenting experience, earned him the best director award at the Cannes Film Festival.","boxset":0,"scraped":1,"directors":[{"name":"Nagisa Oshima","slug":"nagisa-oshima"}],"cast":[{"actor":"Tatsuya Fuji","role":"Toyoji","slug":"tatsuya-fuji"},{"actor":"Kazuko Yoshiyuki","role":"Seki","slug":"kazuko-yoshiyuki"},{"actor":"Takahiro Tamura","role":"Gisaburo","slug":"takahiro-tamura"},{"actor":"Takuzo Kawatani","role":"Officer Hotta","slug":"takuzo-kawatani"},{"actor":"Masami Hasegawa","role":"Shin","slug":"masami-hasegawa"},{"actor":"Akiko Koyama","role":"Landowner’s mother","slug":"akiko-koyama"},{"actor":"Taiji Tonoyama","role":"Toichiro","slug":"taiji-tonoyama"}],"credits":[{"role":"Director","person":"Nagisa Oshima","slug":"nagisa-oshima"},{"role":"Producer","person":"Anatole Dauman","slug":null},{"role":"Screenplay","person":"Nagisa Oshima","slug":"nagisa-oshima"},{"role":"Based on a book by","person":"Itoko Nakamura","slug":null},{"role":"Cinematography","person":"Yoshio Miyajima","slug":null},{"role":"Lighting","person":"Kenichi Okamoto","slug":null},{"role":"Editing","person":"Keiichi Uraoka","slug":null},{"role":"Music","person":"Toru Takemitsu","slu